{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.poster.avif?t=1770075176\" width=800 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.webm?t=1770075176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.mp4?t=1770075176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude78 HOW FAR CAN YOU GET BEFORE THE CRASH?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYSTEMCRASH92</strong> blends <strong>3D side-scroller action</strong> and <strong>turn-based combat</strong> in a survival experience focused on crafting, strategy, and progression.<br>Face endless waves of enemies, gather minerals and gold, craft weapons and metal allies, and survive as long as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd29 3D SURVIVAL RUNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins in a side-scrolling arena.<br>Defeat enemies, collect minerals and gold, purchase <strong>power-ups during the run</strong>, and gain experience to <strong>level up, unlock abilities, and improve your stats</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Every 4 minutes, a boss portal becomes available.</strong><br>If 4 minutes pass without activating it, the system enters a critical state and the <strong>Final Wave</strong> begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/2092e61c0ca9e82d4fd919f72430a73a.poster.avif?t=1770075176\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/2092e61c0ca9e82d4fd919f72430a73a.webm?t=1770075176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/2092e61c0ca9e82d4fd919f72430a73a.mp4?t=1770075176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 METAL ALLIES AND CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use minerals to <strong>craft metallic allies</strong>, units that fight alongside you in real time, and weapons that define each run\u2019s build.<br>Combine different types of allies, weapons, and abilities to create unique strategies and adapt to the increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters: what to craft, when to do it, and how to build your team can be the difference between surviving\u2026 or collapsing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/aa8e5b661da61c09359c8e8fc2deb986.poster.avif?t=1770075176\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/aa8e5b661da61c09359c8e8fc2deb986.webm?t=1770075176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/aa8e5b661da61c09359c8e8fc2deb986.mp4?t=1770075176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Side-scroller action gameplay<br>\u2692\ufe0f Crafting of weapons and metallic allies using minerals<br>\ud83d\udcb0 Power-ups purchased with gold during the run<br>\u23f1\ufe0f Boss portal every 4 minutes; <strong>Final Wave</strong> if not activated<br>\ud83e\udde0 Leveling system with abilities and stat upgrades<br>\ud83d\udcbe Persistent progression: level, minerals, and gold<br>\ud83d\udd01 Highly replayable runs with progressive difficulty</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2411880?t=1770075176","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2411880?t=1770075176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/a907722e48d0e62969aff09e8e316a013bc96813/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770075176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/a907722e48d0e62969aff09e8e316a013bc96813/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770075176","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.poster.avif?t=1770075176\" width=800 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.webm?t=1770075176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.mp4?t=1770075176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude78 HOW FAR CAN YOU GET BEFORE THE CRASH?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYSTEMCRASH92</strong> blends <strong>3D side-scroller action</strong> and <strong>turn-based combat</strong> in a survival experience focused on crafting, strategy, and progression.<br>Face endless waves of enemies, gather minerals and gold, craft weapons and metal allies, and survive as long as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd29 3D S